diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index 37e1ee12a..f3bbff2af 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -369,7 +369,8 @@ Make some of the data-dense advisors use using a **higher constrast background t
 - **Beautified** the **Domestic Advisor**: now shows the **button (i.e. icon) of the current item being built** (unit, building, project, process) in "Producing" column. Use the **shared advisor shell layout** (**top/bottom bars** + single content panel, remove the old exit icon) so Domestic Advisor **mirrors other advisors' structure** instead of a floating table, and is now has **tabs**; **enhanced** the Domestic Advisor so it now has **4 overview tabs** with detailed city information (modifiers, yields, specialists, etc.) with a corresponding **legend link**, and an **enter city on click button** (mirroring the info screen's wonders tab). Change in [CvDomesticAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvDomesticAdvisor.py).
 - Minor **beautified** the [CvCustomizableDomesticAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvCustomizableDomesticAdvisor.py): increase **legend culture text width** so it is not cramped when upscaled. Note: although it is functional, the Custom Domestic Advisor is **not supported** in AdvCiv-SAS as of now, so it is lacking the Finance Tab. See also [KI#123](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#123---fixed-bug-domesticmilitary-advisor-variant-toggles-required-restarting-civ4).
 - New **Policy Advisor**. **Beautified**: enlarge **top panels text** so **long civic names don't overflow**. **Remove multiline nationality** information which was **uninfomative** and **crowded vertically** in the **Religions tab** and the **Corporations tab**; use more precise and compact `Leader (ID)` and `HQ (ID)` **one-liner instead** (**ID** also handles **one leader name being used by several players**); **increase row spacing** (now **unified** (was crowded)). **Remove multiline wrapped bonuses** splitting logic in the **Corporations tab**: use one natural comma-separated line (bonuses row height reduced/standardized) since there is enough space after expanding the Policy Advisor and it is more readable. Also add **new rows** (**Bonuses Generated**, **Yields Generated**), and add **first column descriptions** for rows (as of now `Built By:`, `Consumes:`, `Generates:`, `Generates 2:`). Add a **Great Person icon** in `Built By:` row. Change in [CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvPolicyAdvisorScreen.py).
-- **Foreign Advisor**: refined its tabs so they can display **up to 12 players**. Notably renamed the Active tab to **Treaties** tab (no longer shows redundant bonuses (since their deal can be cancelled from the bonuses tab)), and **beautified** it with **icons**. Always use the unified **table-style info layout** (`drawInfoImproved`) for the Info Tab for stable column behavior: the old hardcoded text spacing (`drawInfoOriginal`) did not **scale with upscaled font text** nor **adjust depending on advisor screen size**. Plus the improved layout has additional **information** like general or specific **colored leader attitude text** related to civic/religion choices (e.g., `[-2]` or `[+1]`), so the old **Enhanced Info Tab** BUG option was removed (to better support upscaled text and game resolution changes). The remaining Glance-tab attitude dropdown now has its own explicit **Glance Tab Attitudes** row for clarity instead of looking attached to the Info-tab option, and now defaults to **Both (numbers and smilies)** instead of the previous **Numbers**-only default, after Large Pangaea/default-player testing showed an upscaled long case such as `-17` with at-war and worst-enemy icons still displayed fully after the per-page player cap. Higher-player games were not tested here and may behave differently; the tunable cap remains the adjustment point if needed. See [KI#139](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#139---fixed-base-advciv-issue-foreign-advisor-bug-menu-made-glance-attitude-dropdown-look-attached-to-enhanced-info-tab). **Beautified** the **Espionage Tab** similarly; notably **removed redundant Espionage slider** now that commerce sliders are on the right side of main interface in map view, and **improved text spacing** that **was colliding or overflowing** beyond its panel, and **moved + - buttons under the leader icon** where there is more room and it is more intuitive and easier to click it. Show **gold per turn** in **Bonuses Tab** even when **not connected to trade network** (if gold trading is available): previously this was hidden, and would require tediously opening the diplomacy screen of each player, and this is now also consistent with flat gold being shown in techs tab for all players (if gold trading is available). See [KI#132](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#132---enhanced-base-advciv-issue-of-not-showing-rival-gold-per-turn-on-foreign-trade-advisor-bonuses-tab-when-not-connected-to-their-trade-network).
+- **Foreign Advisor**: refined its tabs so they can display **up to 12 players**. Notably renamed the Active tab to **Treaties** tab (no longer shows redundant bonuses (since their deal can be cancelled from the bonuses tab)), and **beautified** it with **icons**. Always use the unified **table-style info layout** (`drawInfoImproved`) for the Info Tab for stable column behavior: the old hardcoded text spacing (`drawInfoOriginal`) did not **scale with upscaled font text** nor **adjust depending on advisor screen size**. Plus the improved layout has additional **information** like general or specific **colored leader attitude text** related to civic/religion choices (e.g., `[-2]` or `[+1]`), so the old **Enhanced Info Tab** BUG option was removed (to better support upscaled text and game resolution changes). The remaining Glance-tab attitude dropdown now has its own explicit **Glance Tab Attitudes** row for clarity instead of looking attached to the Info-tab option, and now defaults to **Both (numbers and smilies)** instead of the previous **Numbers**-only default, after Large Pangaea/default-player testing showed an upscaled long case such as `-17` with at-war and worst-enemy icons still displayed fully after the per-page player cap. Higher-player games were not tested here and may behave differently; the tunable cap remains the adjustment point if needed. See [KI#139](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#139---fixed-base-advciv-issue-foreign-advisor-bug-menu-made-glance-attitude-dropdown-look-attached-to-enhanced-info-tab). Show **gold per turn** in **Bonuses Tab** even when **not connected to trade network** (if gold trading is available): previously this was hidden, and would require tediously opening the diplomacy screen of each player, and this is now also consistent with flat gold being shown in techs tab for all players (if gold trading is available). See [KI#132](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#132---enhanced-base-advciv-issue-of-not-showing-rival-gold-per-turn-on-foreign-trade-advisor-bonuses-tab-when-not-connected-to-their-trade-network).
+- **Beautified** the **Espionage Tab** similarly; notably **removed redundant Espionage slider** now that commerce sliders are on the right side of main interface in map view, and **improved text spacing** that **was colliding or overflowing** beyond its panel, and **moved + - buttons under the leader icon** where there is more room and it is more intuitive and easier to click it. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5902+) Removed redundant and distracting `Weight:`, espionage char icon, and `Cost` text (add a **Legend** link explaining the row fields), and added a new **compact mode** with tunable met rivals cap (0 effectively means always use it) so large player counts (e.g., in SAS48 world-size) are visible and selectable.
 - Added **"Willing to become vassal"** and **"Vassal"** **icons** in the Foreign Advisor's Glance tab in the human player's row, to help avoid the need to tediously check these up through other screens, in [CvForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvForeignAdvisor.py), and in [CvDLLWidgetData.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDLLWidgetData.cpp) for the corresponding **tooltip** (on hover). See ["Willing to become a vassal" and "vassal" icons](/README.md#willing-to-become-a-vassal-and-vassal-icons-in-foreign-advisors-glance-tab).
 - Cap **maximum number of players per page** in the **Glance Tab** (e.g., max 16 players per page gives 3 pages at SAS48 Worldsize (if all players are known)), with **clickable left and right arrows for navigation**. Fixes **issue of Glance Tab clipping horizontally** if more than 24 players are known and columns being too tight. Last page visited is **remembered and resumed from** on Glance Tab next opening. Diagonal player-vs-itself cells are now left empty instead of showing incorrect/inconsistent `+0` attitude display; see [KI#140](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#140---fixed-base-advciv-issue-foreign-advisor-glance-tab-showed-incorrect-and-inconsistent-0-attitude-display-in-self-cells). See also [KI#134](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#134---fixed-base-advciv-issue-foreign-diplomacy-advisor-glance-tab-column-icons-overflow-horizontally-with-24-rival-players).
 - Reworked the **Military Advisor** in [CvMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMilitaryAdvisor.py) now with Unit Combat and Units **icons**. Note: **unit icon size** is **increased** at **higher resolutions** (e.g., from 24 to 32 if resolution height >= 1440), and **promotion icon size** is **increased** (no longer DLL-hardcoded (was 16)). **Lift up the unit panel to full height** (reduces the need for scrolling vertically) and **expand it laterally** to **accommodate lengthy unit rows** (e.g., avoid line wrap if unit name is long, if there are many promotions). Make **show/hide individual unit text clickable** too (more accessible than the small +/- button alone). **Increase leader icon bar from 1 to multiple rows**, and **do not reduce icon size until all rows are full**. For example, at 1080p, 5 rows allow to show up to 45 players (including barbarian) at full leader icon size before leader icon size is reduced. **Reduce Leader icon size reduction** when all rows are full (**mild reduction**, no longer halved). In **debug mode**, the **Map tab** now draws the **full minimap section** instead of only the active player's known minimap section: the full map is visible in debug anyway, and this lets the human/debugger locate selected players' units even outside the active player's revealed area. See [KI#142](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#142---fixed-base-advciv-issue-military-advisor-map-tab-debug-mode-did-not-draw-the-full-minimap-section). See also [KI#123](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#123---fixed-bug-domesticmilitary-advisor-variant-toggles-required-restarting-civ4), [KI#130](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#130---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-unit-rows-showing-build-player-name-instead-of-improvement-text-military-advisor-map-tab), and [KI#131](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#131---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-live-unit-build-action-text-not-being-space-separated-from-its-turn-timer). Note 2: as of now the [CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvBUGMilitaryAdvisor.py) is not supported.

